       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "id": "25585381",
       "source": "PubMed"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Has antimicrobial activity against Gram-positive bacteria, including Staphylococcus aureus and Actinomyces spec., and Mycoplasma hominis and lentivirus (PubMed:25585381)"
    }
